libmpuio: libmpuio (formatted I/O library for LibMPU)
libmpuio:
libmpuio: LibMPUIO is a stdio-like input/output library designed for LibMPU.
libmpuio: It provides files, streams, formatted input/output, memory streams,
libmpuio: cookie streams, buffering, positioning, locking, and pipe support.
libmpuio: Text is represented internally as UCS-2 and externally as UTF-8.
libmpuio: printf and scanf functions support standard C objects as well as
libmpuio: arbitrary precision integer, real, and complex LibMPU objects.
libmpuio:
libmpuio: Homepage: https://git.radix-linux.su/libs/libmpuio.git/
